      "start": 6.74,
      "end": 14.42,
      "text": "It's twelve o'clock Americans, another day closer to victory, and for all of you out",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 14.42,
      "end": 19.98,
      "text": "they're on at the high in the lines. This is your song.",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 33.06,
      "end": 40.94,
      "text": "This war is a lie. Judge the righteous from their place on high. But I wonder who",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 40.94,
      "end": 51.62,
      "text": "they blame if their ivory towers were set aflame? And how did it seem to watch 9-11 on a TV screen",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 52.94,
      "end": 58.54,
      "text": "while we lived through it, cities burning in a fiery pitch?",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 63.26,
      "end": 70.42,
      "text": "We march across the killing fields. We set the laws with swords and shields.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 70.42,
      "end": 73.64,
      "text": "Our funeral pyres light up the sky",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 73.64,
      "end": 77.16,
      "text": "We send our children off to die",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 77.16,
      "end": 80.34,
      "text": "Treacherous paths we walk alone",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 80.34,
      "end": 83.82,
      "text": "Our hands and hearts have turned to stone",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 83.82,
      "end": 87.36,
      "text": "These are the chances that we take",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 87.36,
      "end": 90.86,
      "text": "The sacrifices that we make",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
